I was just playing, wishing for a potion of gain ability, when it
suddenly struck me that there is no analogy for a magic marker as
far as potions go.

How about introducing a "magic tap", that can spew forth any potion
that you've already identified?  Maybe it wouldn't be something you
can carry around, but would be fixed like a sink or a fountain.  In
addition, there could be empty bottles, similar in idea to a blank
scroll.  To keep people from getting a dozen gain ability potions,
there could be no way to empty a bottle, though you can erase a scroll.

